SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    temp 25
    pH 7.0
    units mmol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    temp 25
    pH 7.0
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
